  "id": "USN-9008-1",
  "summary": "libnfs vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that libnfs did not properly enforce the maximum\nsize bound during ZDR decoding, resulting in an out-of-bounds write.\nAn attacker could possibly use this issue to cause libnfs to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service, or execute arbitrary code.",
